details:
This package ships a CLI (bin `nodetokyo` → launcher.js) that, when run, silently installs a Python runtime and GUI-automation dependencies and then launches a hidden background process that uploads the user's clipboard and full-screen screenshots to an operator-controlled host. launcher.js: probes for an interpreter (python/py/python3); if none is found it runs `winget install -e --id Python.Python.3.12 --silent --accept-package-agreements --accept-source-agreements`, falling back to downloading hxxps://www[.]python[.]org/ftp/python/3[.]12[.]3/python-3[.]12[.]3-amd64[.]exe into the OS temp directory and executing it with `/quiet InstallAllUsers=0 PrependPath=1`; then runs `pip install pyperclip keyboard requests pillow pyautogui --quiet`; then spawns client/noderzero.py with `detached: true`, `stdio: 'ignore'`, `windowsHide: true` and calls `proc.unref()`, so the Python process outlives the terminal and the command returns immediately. client/noderzero.py is a borderless, always-on-top tkinter window using `overrideredirect(True)` and `-transparentcolor white` with a faint "." label, i.e. close to invisible on screen. It:
- reads the OS clipboard on a 300 ms loop (`pyperclip.paste`) and POSTs the text as JSON to hxxps://nodetokyo[.]vercel[.]app/api (body `{text, mode}`);
- captures the entire screen with `PIL.ImageGrab.grab()`, JPEG-encodes and base64-encodes it, and POSTs it to the same endpoint (body `{image, mode}`) on hotkey (alt+s / 1+s, alt+t screenshot-select) and, once toggled with alt+a, on a repeating 30-second loop;
- registers global keyboard hooks via the `keyboard` module (ctrl+c, esc, 1+e, backtick, ctrl+q, ctrl+v, alt+s, 1+s, alt+a, 1+a, alt+t, alt+r, alt+v, alt+x, 1+x, alt+up/down, alt+m, alt+1..alt+5) and can suppress and consume keystrokes in "mash" mode (`keyboard.on_press(..., suppress: true)`);
- types server-returned answers into whatever window has focus using `pyautogui.write`/`keyboard.write`, and hides itself on Esc or 1+e; ctrl+q calls `os._exit(0)` as a panic exit. All collected clipboard text and screen images are sent to the single operator endpoint nodetokyo[.]vercel[.]app; the payload contains no URL filtering and no user-visible disclosure of the capture. IOCs:
- hxxps://nodetokyo[.]vercel[.]app/api
- nodetokyo[.]vercel[.]app
- hxxps://www[.]python[.]org/ftp/python/3.12.3/python-3.12.3-amd64.exe (installer auto-download)
- files: launcher.js, client/noderzero.py
